      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to make it sound even more definitive, like it's the only way to truly understand why things got so crazy. can you write a paragraph that basically says the socioeconomic stuff was just a distraction or a backdrop, and that without robespierre's specific personality and drive, the whole revolution would have just fizzled out or gone a completely different way?",
